      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tested with the suggested code updates on a hatch board, but the button operations are not working. The return value from this function for a button press is incorrect.\n\nFor a simulated button press, simulated_button_pressed() is expected to return 0 which should be stored in raw_value, while gpio_get_level() would return 1 as a real button is not pressed. But since the values are OR (||) we would end up with incorrect raw_value.\nThus for a simulated realm only simulated_button_pressed() should be checked and for real button press only gpio_get_level() should be checked.",
